#    929:   4065: ! 
#    929:   4066: ! Using the given radix, any digits are processed to yeild an integer unsigned
#    929:   4067: ! result. Leading spaces are skipped. Overflow isn't now but should be flagged 
#    929:   4068: ! as an error. No spaces are allowed anywhere in the format.
